DERIVED — variance components, CV^2 = B^2 + S^2/N
  N=65  -> CV 4.261%
  N=160 -> CV 2.618%
  pure 1/sqrt(N) prediction for N=160 from the N=65 point: 2.716%
  OBSERVED 2.618%  (0.1 pp below prediction)
  solving both equations: per-step CV S = 35.2%,  B^2 = -0.881
  => the BETWEEN-LAUNCH variance component is indistinguishable from ZERO on a
     pinned quiesced box. Process launch, re-mmap of EMBED.BIN, page-cache state
     and ASLR contribute NO measurable variance to decode cycles/token.
  => residual variance is iid per-step jitter and averages down as 1/sqrt(N).

DERIVED — required decode steps per arm, pinned quiesced Linux,
two-sample 95% conf / 80% power, S = 34.3%/step:
   1% effect -> 18,501 steps/arm  (~43 s of decode/arm)
